'''Tarantula Vermin''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} for the [[Spider Slayer]].

== Spawning ==
The '''Tarantula Vermin''' spawns rarely when a player kills a [[Spider]] while a [[Tarantula Broodfather]] {{SlayerTier|III}}+ Slayer quest is active. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place, and the Tarantula Vermin spawns at the location where the spider was killed.

== Behavior ==
The '''Tarantula Vermin''' attempts to leap toward players to damage them on contact.

